   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Rural Village Redesign</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Rural Village Redesign: Before and After (Semantic Differential)\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original scenes: participants see 18 rendered views of Nanlizhuang village (Hebei, China), nine places (A1-A3 street spaces, B1-B3 residential courtyards, C1-C3 node spaces) each shown before (-1) and after (-2) a redesign that adds natural elements and cultural features. Each view is shown for 20 s; participants then rate it on the paper's 17 bipolar word pairs (16 'Imagine you're in this scene and you feel' pairs such as comfortable-uncomfortable, willing to stay-wanting to pass quickly, natural-artificial, beautiful-ugly, safe-unsafe, plus one 'can you feel the emotions that come with the scene' pair), each scored 2, 1, 0, -1, -2 with the positive word on the left, followed by a 5 s rest. Rebuilt from Shi, Wang & Zhang (2025), Novel insights into rural spatial design: A bio-behavioral study employing eye-tracking and electrocardiography measures, PLOS ONE 20(5): e0322301, with the scenes cropped from its Fig 1 (CC BY 4.0) and the word pairs copied from its Table 3. Image ids are the paper's labels (e.g. B2-1 = courtyard 2 before, B2-2 = after). Analysis as in the paper: mean word-pair score per view, then pre- vs post-design for each of the nine places (Wilcoxon signed-rank test); the paper found every place scored higher after the redesign. Differences from the original study: (1) online and self-paced answering instead of a lab session where staff read the questions and recorded the answers within 40 s; (2) no eye tracking or ECG, so pupil diameter, fixation duration, saccade velocity, SDNN and RMSSD are not recorded; (3) the views are cropped from the published figure (about 700 x 400 px) rather than the 2560 x 1440 originals; (4) the 18 views are shown in a random order per participant (the paper does not state its order) and there is no 10 s adaptation scene; (5) gender, age and education questions are our wording, after the paper's Table 1.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"scenes\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"feel\",\n      \"title\": \"Imagine you're in this scene and you feel\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"calm\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling calm (2) - Feeling excited (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"comfortable\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling comfortable (2) - Feeling uncomfortable (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"special\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling special (2) - Feelings of being everywhere (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"close\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling close (2) - Feeling alienated (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"stay\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling willing to stay (2) - Wanting to pass quickly (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"varied\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling spatially varied (2) - Feeling monotonous in space (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"interesting\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling interesting (2) - Boredom (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"natural\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling natural (2) - Feeling artificial (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"quiet\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling quiet (2) - Feeling noisy (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"beautiful\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling beautiful (2) - Feeling ugly (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"friendly\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling friendly (2) - Feeling unfriendly (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"bright\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling bright (2) - Feeling dim (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"stable\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling stable (2) - Feeling unstable (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"safe\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling safe (2) - Feeling unsafe (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"relaxed\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling relaxed (2) - Feeling aroused (-2)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"positive\",\n        \"text\": \"Feeling positive (2) - Feeling negative (-2)\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 0,\n        \"text\": \"0\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": -1,\n        \"text\": \"-1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": -2,\n        \"text\": \"-2\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Paper's Table 3, 16 word pairs, 2 = left (positive) word, -2 = right word. Keyed by image id.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"emotion\",\n      \"title\": \"Imagine you are in the scene and can you feel the emotions that come with the scene\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateValues\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 0,\n        \"text\": \"0\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": -1,\n        \"text\": \"-1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": -2,\n        \"text\": \"-2\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"perceived discrimination (2)\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"inability to feel (-2)\",\n      \"description\": \"Paper's Table 3, 17th pair, wording as printed. Keyed by image id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"Education level\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"undergraduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Undergraduate\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"postgraduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Postgraduate\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"How old are you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 110\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"rural-original\">{\"source\": \"Shi, Wang & Zhang (2025) PLOS ONE 20(5): e0322301\", \"n\": 30, \"participants\": \"30 undergraduate and master's students (10 male, 20 female), aged 20-30, Hebei University of Engineering lab, June 2024\", \"procedure\": \"10 s adaptation scene; per view 20 s viewing (eye tracking + ECG), then 17 word pairs scored 2..-2 within 40 s (asked and recorded by staff), 5 s rest\", \"scenes\": {\"A\": \"street space\", \"B\": \"residential compound\", \"C\": \"node space\", \"-1\": \"pre-design\", \"-2\": \"post-design\"}, \"results\": {\"subjective\": \"Wilcoxon signed-rank pre vs post p < 0.001; all nine places scored higher after redesign (Fig 10)\", \"pupil_left_t\": -3.188, \"pupil_right_t\": -3.479, \"saccade_velocity_Z\": -2.705, \"pupil_change_improved_scenes\": 6, \"saccade_velocity_decreased_share\": \"89% of scenes\"}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eff1ec;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f241c;--muted:#5b6356;--accent:#4f6b3a;--line:#d8ddd2;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e5eedc}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.view{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#7f7f7f;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:5}\n.view img{width:min(96vw,1100px);max-height:92vh;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.view .rest{color:#eee;font-size:1.1rem}\n.bp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.bp:first-of-type{border-top:0}\n.bp .l{text-align:right;font-size:.92rem}.bp .r{font-size:.92rem}\n.bp .opts{display:flex;gap:4px}\n.bp label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;width:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:3px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.bp label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--ink)}\n.bp input{margin:0 0 1px}\n.bp.miss .opts{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n@media (max-width:560px){.bp{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.bp .l{text-align:left;order:1}.bp .r{text-align:right;order:2}.bp .opts{order:3;grid-column:1/3;justify-content:space-between}.bp label{flex:1}}\n.sub{font-weight:600;margin:16px 0 4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}.f:first-child{margin-top:0}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Scenes: Shi, Wang &amp; Zhang (2025), PLOS ONE 20(5): e0322301, Fig 1 (doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0322301, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='rural-redesign:state', T={view:window.__VIEWMS||20000,rest:window.__VIEWMS||5000};\n  var PAIRS=[[\"calm\", \"Feeling calm\", \"Feeling excited\"], [\"comfortable\", \"Feeling comfortable\", \"Feeling uncomfortable\"], [\"special\", \"Feeling special\", \"Feelings of being everywhere\"], [\"close\", \"Feeling close\", \"Feeling alienated\"], [\"stay\", \"Feeling willing to stay\", \"Wanting to pass quickly\"], [\"varied\", \"Feeling spatially varied\", \"Feeling monotonous in space\"], [\"interesting\", \"Feeling interesting\", \"Boredom\"], [\"natural\", \"Feeling natural\", \"Feeling artificial\"], [\"quiet\", \"Feeling quiet\", \"Feeling noisy\"], [\"beautiful\", \"Feeling beautiful\", \"Feeling ugly\"], [\"friendly\", \"Feeling friendly\", \"Feeling unfriendly\"], [\"bright\", \"Feeling bright\", \"Feeling dim\"], [\"stable\", \"Feeling stable\", \"Feeling unstable\"], [\"safe\", \"Feeling safe\", \"Feeling unsafe\"], [\"relaxed\", \"Feeling relaxed\", \"Feeling aroused\"], [\"positive\", \"Feeling positive\", \"Feeling negative\"]], VALS=[2,1,0,-1,-2];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function val(name){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+name+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function bp(name,a,b){return '<div class=\"bp\" data-n=\"'+name+'\"><span class=\"l\">'+esc(a)+'</span><span class=\"opts\">'+VALS.map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+name+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+(v>0?'+':'')+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</span><span class=\"r\">'+esc(b)+'</span></div>';}\n  function radios(q){return '<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q[q].title)+'</b>'+(Q[q].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+q+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Village spaces</h1><p>You will see '+st.order.length+' computer-rendered views of streets, courtyards and open spaces in a village in northern China. Each view is shown for 20 seconds; just look at it. Afterwards you describe how you would feel in that scene using 17 pairs of opposite words, choosing a number from +2 (the left word fits strongly) to −2 (the right word fits strongly). A short rest follows each scene. It takes about 25 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='trial';st.phase='view';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function trial(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='about';save();return route();}\n    if(st.phase==='q')return ask();\n    var id=st.order[st.k],v=document.createElement('div');v.className='view';app.innerHTML='';app.appendChild(v);\n    if(st.phase==='rest'){v.innerHTML='<div class=\"rest\">Rest</div>';setTimeout(function(){st.k++;st.phase='view';save();route();},T.rest);return;}\n    v.innerHTML='<img alt=\"Village scene\" src=\"'+esc(files[id].url)+'\">';\n    if(st.k+1<st.order.length){var p=new Image();p.src=files[st.order[st.k+1]].url;}\n    setTimeout(function(){st.phase='q';save();route();},T.view);\n  }\n  function ask(){\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id];\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Scene '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"sub\" style=\"margin-top:0\">'+esc(Q.feel.title)+'</div>'+PAIRS.map(function(p){return bp(p[0],p[1],p[2]);}).join('')+'<div class=\"sub\">'+esc(Q.emotion.title)+'</div>'+bp('emotion','perceived discrimination','inability to feel')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var m={},miss=0;app.querySelectorAll('.bp').forEach(function(r){r.classList.remove('miss');});\n      PAIRS.forEach(function(p){var x=val(p[0]);if(x==null){miss++;app.querySelector('.bp[data-n=\"'+p[0]+'\"]').classList.add('miss');}else m[p[0]]=Number(x);});\n      var e=val('emotion');if(e==null){miss++;app.querySelector('.bp[data-n=\"emotion\"]').classList.add('miss');}\n      if(miss)return err('Please answer every row ('+miss+' missing).');\n      send([SPSite.answer('feel',m,{key:id,shown:[f.name]}),SPSite.answer('emotion',Number(e),{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.phase='rest';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+radios('gender')+radios('education')+'<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" id=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"110\"></div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var g=val('gender'),ed=val('education'),age=Number(document.getElementById('age').value);\n      if(!g||!ed)return err('Please answer every question.');if(!(age>=16&&age<=110))return err('Please enter your age.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('gender',g),SPSite.answer('education',ed),SPSite.answer('age',age)],this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.bp');if(r)r.classList.remove('miss');});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='trial')return trial();if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','feel','emotion','gender','education','age'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    var ids=[];\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){if(/\\.(png|jpe?g|webp)$/i.test(f.name)){var k=f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');files[k]=f;ids.push(k);}});\n    if(!ids.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Scenes missing</h1><p>Upload the scene images to the media folder \"scenes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var valid=st&&st.order&&st.order.every(function(x){return files[x];});\n    if(!valid)st={step:'intro',order:shuffle(ids),k:0,phase:'view'};\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};if(a.consent!==true)st={step:'intro',order:shuffle(ids),k:0,phase:'view'};\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
